<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ gave up His life to bring the Father into me,</l><l>Upon the cross He has died in my place,</l><l>And He rose from the dead, Son of Man now to be glorified,</l><l>Christ as a man, now the Spirit of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ now as the Spirit, with the Father in the Son,</l><l>Now in my spirit He dwells within me,</l><l>And He gives life to me as I seek Him each and every day,</l><l>Christ now the life-giving Spirit in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
